{"ID":"20240506112358-efjylp7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506112358-efjylp7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506112358-efjylp7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704114110-i7olayb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614130900-ca5w77r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240705161212-vme27xj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:24,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:24\u0026#125;","title":"383补26小麦（浮小麦）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828161821"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240704114110-i7olayb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114110-i7olayb","updated":"20240704114110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 354px;","style":"width: 344px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦-20240704114110-cvxw2gk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 344px;\" parent-style=\"width: 354px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240704114232-8xosop1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114232-8xosop1","updated":"20240704114547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦2-20240704114232-31fw8fw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦3-20240704114518-9pzu66m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 262px;","style":"width: 252px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦4-20240704114547-x8a0aab.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 252px;\" parent-style=\"width: 262px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704114618-w4o0kk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704114618-w4o0kk9","updated":"20240704115335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦7-20240704115206-o3t6uxb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 372px;","style":"width: 362px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦8-20240704115335-78wddfx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 362px;\" parent-style=\"width: 372px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240704115507-zfm2t7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704115507-zfm2t7f","updated":"20240704115535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 408px;","style":"width: 398px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115521-yrcikwl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 398px;\" parent-style=\"width: 408px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 389px;","style":"width: 379px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115507-s01jyrr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 379px;\" parent-style=\"width: 389px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 485px;","style":"width: 475px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115558-8fkpemz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 475px;\" parent-style=\"width: 485px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704115216-iv4vg58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704115216-iv4vg58","updated":"20240704115443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 454px;","style":"width: 444px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦5-20240704115035-0alnmsr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 444px;\" parent-style=\"width: 454px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 799px;","style":"width: 789px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦9-20240704115443-6eycx68.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 789px;\" parent-style=\"width: 799px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704115700-xjdl6p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704115700-xjdl6p7","updated":"20240828140158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦-20240828135623-e87j7oy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 675px;","style":"width: 665px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115710-w54foht.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 665px;\" parent-style=\"width: 675px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705161212-vme27xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705161212-vme27xj","updated":"20240828161821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：浮小麦指干燥、轻浮、瘪瘦的小麦种子，质轻，遇水能浮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130740-p3as5z4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130740-p3as5z4"}},{"ID":"20240614130918-znraqwy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130918-znraqwy","updated":"20240614130922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130918-fadm0wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130918-fadm0wp","updated":"20240614130918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补心．"}]},{"ID":"20240614130918-0p7e7so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130918-0p7e7so","updated":"20240614130918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微寒．养心除烦．利溲止血．（时珍曰∶按素问云∶麦属火、心之谷也、郑玄礼记注疏云∶麦有莩、甲属木、许慎云∶麦属金、金旺而生、火旺而死、别录云∶养肝、与郑说合、孙思邈云∶养心、与素问合、夷考其功、除烦止渴、收汗利溲、止血、皆心之病也、当以素问为准、仲景治妇人脏躁证、悲伤欲绝、状若神灵、用甘麦汤、大枣十枚、小麦一升、甘草一两、亦补脾气、圣惠方、小麦饭、治烦热少睡多渴．）面、甘温．（时珍曰∶新麦性热、陈麦平和．）补虚养气．助五脏．浓肠胃．北方者良．（南方地暖下湿、便能壅气作渴、助湿发热．市中所卖水面、俱和碱水拌切、不宜食．）秆（烧灰入药、去虎痣、蚀恶肉．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130740-08vgss1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130740-08vgss1"}},{"ID":"20240614130910-72fz8d8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130910-72fz8d8","updated":"20240614130914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130910-cn8hytc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130910-cn8hytc","updated":"20240614130910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘、寒，无毒。主除客热，止烦渴咽燥，利小便，养肝气，止漏血吐血，令女人易孕。（《别录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614131002-vh1sdi7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131002-vh1sdi7"}},{"ID":"20240614131004-id4ud6z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131004-id4ud6z","updated":"20240614131009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131004-eogeqqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131004-eogeqqp","updated":"20240614131004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦甘凉养心肝，除烦止渴利便难，润咽更止漏唾血，浮者盗汗实时干，麦苗退热消酒疸，麦奴治疫解金丹。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131004-x2sldnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131004-x2sldnk","updated":"20240614131004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小，形小也；麦，脉也。以继续谷米，续民命脉，即今人所磨为面食者。无毒。主养心肝气，除热，止烦渴、咽干，利小便，止漏血、唾血、暴淋，杀蛔虫。合汤皆完用之，热家疗也。浮小麦，止盗汗，治大人、小儿骨蒸肌热，妇人劳热。入药微炒。麦苗，味辛，寒，退胸中邪热，消酒毒，除黄胆，利小便。绞汁服之。麦奴，即苗上黑霉。主烦热，解丹石、天行热毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131026-le3tfix","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131026-le3tfix"}},{"ID":"20240614131027-pmaxnuz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131027-pmaxnuz","updated":"20240614131031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131027-1poh9ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131027-1poh9ao","updated":"20240614131027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，无毒。主除热，止燥渴，咽干，利小便，养肝气，止漏血、唾血，以作曲，温温，不能消热止烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131027-1lynm8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131027-1lynm8p","updated":"20240614131027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦合汤皆完用之，热家疗也。作面则温，明 麦亦当如此。今服食家啖面，不及大、麦，犹胜于米耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131027-hm61cub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131027-hm61cub","updated":"20240614131027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕"}]},{"ID":"20240614131027-r9qppzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131027-r9qppzl","updated":"20240614131027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦汤用，不许皮坼，云坼则温，明面不能消热止烦也。小麦曲止痢，平胃，主小儿痫，消食痔。又有女曲、黄蒸。女曲，完小麦为之，一名 子；黄蒸，磨血也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131232-md521ru","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131232-md521ru"}},{"ID":"20240614131234-tbhxely","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131234-tbhxely","updated":"20240614131238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131234-6cg1b34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131234-6cg1b34","updated":"20240614131234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微寒．入手少阴经．功专养心镇肝．得通草治老人五淋．得海藻消项下瘿气．麸醋拌蒸．散血止痛．熨腰脚折伤风湿痹痛．寒湿香港脚．五易至汗出良．浮小麦味咸凉．止虚汗盗汗．劳热骨蒸．即水淘浮起者焙用．麦奴即麦将熟．穗上有黑霉．其黑霉名麦奴．取之治阳毒温毒．渴热发狂．以及温疟甚效．陈麦柴堆在露天者最好．用三五根洗净泥．剪寸许长．煎服．治难产神效．"}]},{"ID":"20240614131221-8qu2tra","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131221-8qu2tra"}},{"ID":"20240614131222-wpc2cjx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131222-wpc2cjx","updated":"20240614131226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131222-17v11n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131222-17v11n0","updated":"20240614131222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀四时中和之气，故味甘，气微寒，无毒。然寒气全在于皮，故面去皮则热，所谓谷属金而糠性热，麦属阳而麸性凉，物物俱一太极也。入手少阴经，少阴有热则燥渴咽干，解少阴之热，则燥渴咽干自止。心与小肠为表里，脏气清腑病自除矣，故利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131222-lecnbqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131222-lecnbqp","updated":"20240614131222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝心为母子之脏，子能令母实，故主养肝气，甘寒走二经，而能益血凉血，故治漏血唾血也。曲性温所以能消谷，止痢，面性热故不能消热止烦。凡入药以北来者为胜，北方霜雪多，地气浓热性减，故北人以之代饭，而不患者，以人所处地势高燥，已无湿热熏蒸之毒，面性又复温平，故能浓肠胃强气力，补诸虚助五脏，真功不减稻粟也。东南卑湿，春多雨水，其湿热之气，人与物皆郁积于内，故食之每多发病，动气发渴，助湿发肿，夏月疟痢尤宜禁之。浮麦即水淘浮起者是也。能止自汗盗汗，亦以北方者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131222-kemm81x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131222-kemm81x","updated":"20240614131222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒食面者，寒食日以纸袋盛面，悬风处数十年亦不坏，取其热性去而毒无也。荞麦面大补精力，实肠胃而消腹中经年所积滓秽，不宜久食，并忌同猪羊肉食。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131222-966xgae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131222-966xgae","updated":"20240614131222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦养心气肝气，止漏红唾红，通淋利小便，除热解烦渴。浮水麦先枯未实，能养心除热，敛虚汗如神，砻磨成麸，实大肠、止泻，水浸为 ，消宿食除膨，作面成挂，充餐不厌，助五脏增益气力，浓肠胃滑白肌肤，性热未免动风，萝卜汁服可解。麦粉即麸面洗斤澄出浆粉也。消痈肿，疗火伤，炒黑醋调，消肿甚效。小麦茎叶名麦穗，去酒疸目黄，苗上黑霉，先枯者名麦奴，却天行热毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131206-m09cdg7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131206-m09cdg7"}},{"ID":"20240614131207-hzy7x8c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131207-hzy7x8c","updated":"20240614131212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131207-60z74rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131207-60z74rm","updated":"20240614131207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，无毒。主除热，止躁渴咽干，利小便，养肝气，止漏血，唾血。以作曲，温。消谷，止痢。作面，温。不能消热，止烦。陈脏器云∶麸和面作饼止泄痢，调中，去热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131207-xh4c3hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131207-xh4c3hj","updated":"20240614131207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日华子云∶面∶养气，补不足，助五脏。麦黄∶温中下气，消食除烦。麸∶凉。治时疾、热疮，汤火疮烂，扑损伤折瘀血。醋炒贴 。麦苗∶凉。除烦闷，解时疾狂热，消酒毒，退胸膈热，患黄胆人绞汁服，并利小肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131045-dq038sc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131045-dq038sc"}},{"ID":"20240614131047-eywqj2z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131047-eywqj2z","updated":"20240614131053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131047-x1tux0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131047-x1tux0w","updated":"20240614131047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘微寒，养心止血，除烦利溲。浮小麦咸凉，止汗凉心退热。麸皮甘寒，与浮麦同性，醋拌蒸，熨滞气痹痛。面筋甘凉，解热和中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131057-db8px1e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131057-db8px1e"}},{"ID":"20240614131058-4crec7m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131058-4crec7m","updated":"20240614131105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131058-36dow64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131058-36dow64","updated":"20240614131058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，无毒。主除热，止躁渴，咽干，利小便，养肝气，止漏血，唾血；以作曲∶温，消谷止痢；以作面∶温，不能消热，止烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131113-uhdl84e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131113-uhdl84e"}},{"ID":"20240614131114-iyrsygo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-iyrsygo","updated":"20240614131120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-fqltlir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-fqltlir","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，无毒。主除热，止躁渴咽干，利小便，养肝气，止漏血、唾血。以作曲，温，消谷，止痢。以作面，温，不能消热止烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-wi5qtvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-wi5qtvx","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶小麦合汤皆完用之，热家疗也。作面则温，明 麦亦当如此。今服食家啖面，不及大 麦，犹胜于米尔。唐本注云∶小麦汤用，不许皮坼，云坼则温，明面不能消热止烦也。小麦曲止痢，平胃，主小儿痫，消食痔。又有女曲、黄蒸。女曲，完小麦为之，一名 （音桓）子；黄蒸，磨小麦为之，一名黄衣。并消食，止泄痢，下胎，破冷血也。今按陈藏器本草云∶小麦，秋种夏熟，受四时气足，自然兼有寒温，面热麸冷，宜其然也。河、渭以西，白麦面凉，以其春种阙二时气，使之然也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本云∶以作 ，微寒。主消渴，止烦；以作曲，止痢，平胃，主小儿痫，消食痔。萧炳云∶麦酱和鲤鱼食之，令人口疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-7q0qspm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-7q0qspm","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药性论云∶小麦，臣，有小毒。能杀肠中蛔虫，熬末服。陈藏器云∶麸，味甘，寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-p89iutp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-p89iutp","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和面作饼，止泄利，调中，去热，健人，蒸热袋盛，熨人。马冷失腰脚，和醋蒸，抱所伤折处，止痛散血。人作面，第三磨者凉，为近麸也。小麦，皮寒肉热。又云∶麦苗，味辛，寒，无毒。主酒疸目黄，消酒毒暴热。麦苗上黑霉名麦奴，主热烦，解丹石，天行热毒。又云面，味甘，温。补虚，实人肤体，浓肠胃，强气力，性拥热，小动风气。又云∶女曲，一名子．按 子与黄蒸不殊。黄蒸，温补，消诸生物。北人以小麦，南人以粳米，皆六、七月作之。苏又云磨破之，谓当完作之，亦呼为黄衣，尘绿者佳。孟诜云∶小麦，平，服之止渴。又，作面有热毒，多是陈 之色。作粉补中益气，和五脏，调脉。又，炒粉一合，和服断下痢。又，性主伤折，和醋蒸之，裹所伤处便定。重者，再蒸裹之，甚良。日华子云∶面，养气，补不足，助五脏，久食实人。又云麦黄，暖。温中下气，消食除烦。麸，凉。治时疾，热疮，汤火疮烂，扑损伤折瘀血，醋炒贴 。麦苗，凉。除烦闷，解时疾狂热，消酒毒，退胸膈热。患黄胆人绞汁服，并利小肠，作齑吃，甚益颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-ass5g0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-ass5g0t","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶麦有大麦、小麦、 麦、荞麦，旧不着所出州土。苏云大麦出关中，今南北之人皆能种莳。屑之作面，平胃，止渴，消食。水渍之生芽为 ，化宿食，破冷气，止心腹胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-weki7xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-weki7xd","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今二种∶一种类小麦，一种类大麦，皆比大、小麦差大。凡麦秋种冬长，春秀夏实，具四时中和之气，故为五谷之贵。大、小麦，地暖处亦可春种之，至夏便收。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-idq8i31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-idq8i31","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故有毒。小麦性寒，作面则温而有毒，作曲则平胃止利。其皮为麸，性复寒，调中去热，亦犹大豆作酱、豉，性便不同也。荞麦实肠胃，益气力，然不宜多食，亦能动风气，令人昏眩也。药品不甚用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-imwqovx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-imwqovx","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食疗云∶平。养肝气，煮饮服之良。又云∶面有热毒者，为多是陈 之色。又，为磨中石末在内，所以有毒，但杵食之即良。又宜作粉食之，补中益气，和五脏，调经络，续气脉。圣惠用小麦作饭，水淘食之。又方∶主妇人乳痈不消。右用白面半斤，炒令黄色，用醋煮为糊，涂于乳上，即消。外台秘要∶治痢，色白不消者，为寒下。方∶好面米粥，纳面方寸匕。又云∶此疗泻百行，师不救者。千金方∶治黄胆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-9g4jrxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-9g4jrxg","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮六、七合，昼夜三、四饮之，三、四日便愈。又方∶治火疮。熬面入栀或掺，瘥。肘后方∶主食过饱烦闷，但欲卧而腹胀一切伤折。寒食蒸饼限多少，末，酒服之，验。经验方∶治鼻衄。以冷水调面浆，服之立瘥。又方∶治吹奶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-lgl2ccw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-lgl2ccw","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水调面煮如糊，欲熟即投无灰酒一盏，共搅之，极热，令如稀粥，可饮即热吃。仍令人徐徐按之，头上皮虚肿，薄如蒸饼，状如裹木。以口嚼敷之，瘥。孙真人麦，心之谷也，心病宜食。主除热止渴，利小便，养心气。又方∶治酒黄。取小麦三升杵，和少如金色，小便赤。取小麦杵取汁，服一合。食医醋和作弹丸二、三十个，乘热吞三、两个。其哕定八丸尚未定，晚后饭前再作吞之。鬼遗方∶治金疮腹肠出，不能纳之。小麦五升，水九升，煮取四升，去滓绵滤，使极冷。令人含 之，疮肠渐渐入，冷其旁人语，又不须令病患知，肠不即入。取病患卧席四角，合病患举摇，稍须臾便肠自入。十日中，食不饱，数食须使少。勿使惊，即杀人。别说云∶谨按小麦，即今人所磨为面，日常食者。八、九月种，夏至煎熟。一种春种，作面不及经年者良。大麦作饭滑，饲马良。 麦，今以似小麦而大粒，色青黄，作面脆硬，食多胀人。京东、西，河北近京，又呼为黄颗。关中又有一种青颗，比近道者粒微小，色微青，专以饲马，未见入药用。然大麦、麦二种，其名差互，今之 麦与小麦相似而差大，宜为之大麦。今之大麦不与小麦相似，而其皮矿脆，宜为之 麦。用此恐传记因俗而差之尔，不可不审也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131114-iopl25i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131114-iopl25i","updated":"20240614131114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶小麦，暴淋煎汤饮，为面作糊。入药水调，治人中暑。马病肺卒热，亦以水调灌愈。生嚼成筋，可以粘禽虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131125-3f5z4n6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131125-3f5z4n6"}},{"ID":"20240614131126-t4nqy4z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131126-t4nqy4z","updated":"20240614131136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131126-95vgkog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131126-95vgkog","updated":"20240614131126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"暴淋煎汤饮，为面作糊。入药，水调，治人中暑。马病肺卒热，亦以水调灌愈。生嚼成筋，可以粘禽虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131143-yc589bg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131143-yc589bg"}},{"ID":"20240614131144-8i1e2mz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-8i1e2mz","updated":"20240614131149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-az1p79r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-az1p79r","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大小麦秋种冬长。春秀夏实。具四时之气。故为五谷贵。地暖处亦可春种。至夏而四气不足。故有毒。（颂）麦性恶湿。久潦即多不熟。（濒湖）味甘。气微寒。入手少阴太阳经。新麦性热。陈麦平和。（濒湖）主养心气。止虚汗。心病宜食之。除客热烦渴咽燥。（作汤不许皮坼。坼则性温。不能消热烦止"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-ytibbxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-ytibbxj","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白面"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-zdlsom7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-zdlsom7","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘温。性壅热。（不能消热止烦）有微毒。（吞汉椒。食萝卜。能解。）小动风气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-cqy1g49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-cqy1g49","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈麦面。水煮食之。无毒。主治养气补不足。久食实肤体。浓肠胃。水调服。治中暑。及止鼻衄吐血。（诸本草）方书治痰饮喘吐利舌衄头痛心痛胃脘痛。东南卑湿。春雨多。麦受湿气窖令人补虚寒以凉。皆入药尤良代清阳之寒〔麦面总论〕二麦发生于降收之候。值夏气蕃盛而即告成。是其育质受气。从少阴而归至阴一之粗。而非其应之失守而参之中暑一治可见。特西北产者滋益。而东南者阶厉耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-23yq6dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-23yq6dl","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡人脾胃有湿热。及小儿食积疳胀。皆不宜服。夏月疟痢人。更忌之。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-23qgpcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-23qgpcn","updated":"20240614131155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮麦（浮小麦）"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-idm64f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-idm64f9","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取水淘浮起者。焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-009692c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-009692c","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘咸。气寒。益气除热。止自汗盗汗。骨蒸虚热。治妇人劳热。按浮麦全得寒性。故能止汗"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-qgrsfp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-qgrsfp5","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦麸"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-ppmz1nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-ppmz1nw","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与浮麦性同。而止汗之功次之。治行痹盗汗。和面作饼。（即曲也）消谷止痢。手足风湿走气作痛。用酽醋拌麸皮。炒热。袋盛熨之。互易。至汗出良。寒湿香港脚。治同。产后虚汗。小麦麸牡蛎等分。为末。以猪肉汁调服二钱。日二服。凡人身体疼痛。及疮疡肠烂沾渍或小儿暑月出痘疮。溃烂不能着席卧者。并用夹褥盛麸缝合藉卧。性凉而软。诚妙法也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-n0xsoyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-n0xsoyd","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦粉"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-zwf3u27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-zwf3u27","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面洗筋后澄出者。俗名小粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-cwdq4l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-cwdq4l8","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。气凉。醋熬成膏。消一切痈肿汤火伤。乌龙膏。治一切痈肿发背。无名肿毒。初发热摊纸上尽而脱"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-tip4l59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-tip4l59","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大麦"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-cuf19dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-cuf19dg","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸温。微寒。主消渴。除热。宽胸下气。平胃化谷食。疗胀满止泻。不动风燥热糊。令〔论〕大小麦虽种获同时。而小麦却后于大麦。是则大麦之不动风气。与无燥热。胜于小麦而能当少"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-uboknvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-uboknvj","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荞麦"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-awex8ob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-awex8ob","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸平。气微寒。降气宽肠。炼五脏滓秽。磨积滞。疗白浊白带。脾积泄泻。治痢疾。用面二钱。沙糖水调。炒服。绞肠痧痛。炒焦荞面。热水冲服。食之难消。其有沉积在肠胃者。反藉之消去。（颖）肚腹微微作痛。出即泻。泻亦不多。日夜数行者。用荞麦面一味。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-j8626pc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-j8626pc","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作饮。连食三四次即愈。此可征其炼积滞之功。咳嗽上气。荞麦粉四两。茶末二钱。生蜜二两。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131144-7mbhbz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131144-7mbhbz0","updated":"20240614131144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡以〔论〕荞麦始终得金气之全。金合于火以生化。故叶绿而茎赤。（凡物之生莫不资于风木之霜者之疾脾胃虚寒人食之。则大脱元气而落须眉。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240614131036-cp7znv6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131036-cp7znv6"}},{"ID":"20240614131037-ylxubxa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131037-ylxubxa","updated":"20240614131041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131037-19wvlwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131037-19wvlwq","updated":"20240614131037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微寒．味甘．无毒．主除客热．止烦渴咽燥．利小便．养肝气．止漏血唾血．令女人易孕．小麦气微寒．禀天冬寒之水气．入足少阴肾经．味甘无毒．得地中正之土味．入足太阴脾经．气味降多于升．阴也．客热外热也．小麦味甘而润．润则阴生．故除客热．少阴之脉络咽．水不制火．则烦渴咽干．小麦气寒．则壮水清火．故止烦燥．肾与膀胱为表里．气寒益肾．则膀胱热退而小便利矣．肾水足则生肝木．木滋则气平．所以养肝气也．脾统血．血热则妄行．下漏上吐矣．味甘益脾．气寒清热．所以止唾漏也．甘润益血．女人以血为主．血足所以易孕也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614131037-83dplez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131037-83dplez","updated":"20240614131037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240614131037-eiycnzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131037-eiycnzg","updated":"20240614131037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦同通草．治五淋腹满．同甘草、大枣．治女人脏燥悲啼．"}]},{"ID":"20240614131014-9xjaw2l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614131014-9xjaw2l"}},{"ID":"20240614131015-7g4nzcr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-7g4nzcr","updated":"20240614131020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614131015-nunwfm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-nunwfm0","updated":"20240614131015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补"}]},{"ID":"20240614131015-3emydmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-3emydmi","updated":"20240614131015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微寒。养心除烦，利溲止血（李时珍曰∶《素问》麦属火，心之谷也；郑玄谓属木；许慎谓属金；《别录》云养肝，与郑说合；孙思邈云养心，与《素问》合，当以《素问》为准。按∶麦，秋种夏熟，备受四时之气。南方地暖下湿，不如北产者良。张仲景治妇人脏躁证，悲伤欲绝，状若神灵，用甘麦大枣汤。大枣十枚，小麦一升，甘草一两，每服一两，亦补脾气。《圣惠方》∶小麦饭治烦热。少睡，多渴）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131015-3dykb07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-3dykb07","updated":"20240614131015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面粉甘温。补虚养气，助五脏，浓肠胃，然能壅气作渴，助湿发热。陈者良（寒食日，纸袋盛，悬风处，名寒食面，年久不热，入药尤良）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131015-13tstwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-13tstwb","updated":"20240614131015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮小麦（即水淘浮起者）咸凉。止虚汗盗汗，劳热骨蒸（汗为心液，麦为心谷，浮者无肉，故能凉心。麦麸同功）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614131015-6q8tr8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614131015-6q8tr8g","updated":"20240614131015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦麸醋拌蒸，能散血止痛，熨腰脚折伤，风湿痹痛，寒湿香港脚，互易至汗出良（麦之凉，全在皮，故面去皮即热，凡疮疡痘疮溃烂不能着席者，用麦麸装褥卧，性凉而软，诚妙法也）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130951-jis9sov","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130951-jis9sov"}},{"ID":"20240614130952-smfpm17","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-smfpm17","updated":"20240614130957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-rbn6kbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-rbn6kbn","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」来。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-57mt3l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-57mt3l8","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」小麦（小麦的果实）：甘、微寒、无毒浮麦：甘、咸、寒、无毒。面粉：甘、温、有微毒。不能消热止烦"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-bb37fjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-bb37fjg","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-yqcvpdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-yqcvpdg","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦（小麦的果实）："}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-gseq347","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-gseq347","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、老人淋。用小麦一升、通草二两，加水三升煮成一升饮服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-52jwj2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-52jwj2t","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、项瘿。用小麦一升，在醋一升中泡过，晒干为末，加海藻（洗净，研为末）三两，和匀，每服一匙，酒送下。一天服三次"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-36434ol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-36434ol","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、白癜风。用小麦摊上，烧铁物压出油，搽涂患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-g74e5lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-g74e5lc","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、汤火伤。用小麦炒黑，研为末，加腻粉，调油涂伤处。勿接触冷水。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-vopmyu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-vopmyu4","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、头疮。用小麦烧存性，研为末，调油敷患处。浮麦：益气，除热，止自汗盗汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-69deev3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-69deev3","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦麸："}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-ezdcqb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-ezdcqb4","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、产后虚汗。用小麦麸、牡蛎，等分为末加猪肉汁调服二钱。一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-20baaff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-20baaff","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、身上瘢痕。春夏用大麦麸，秋冬用小麦麸，筛粉，调油敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-u7g5b5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-u7g5b5g","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小便尿血。麦麸炒香，以肥猪肉蘸食。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-n9zl3zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-n9zl3zr","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、热疮，汤火伤。用醋拌麦麸熨贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-1wbnhik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-1wbnhik","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面粉："}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-aei39in","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-aei39in","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、内伤吐血。用面粉略炒，以京墨汁或藕节汁调服二钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-yh7zyfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-yh7zyfb","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、大出血（口、耳、鼻都出血）。用白面加盐少许，冷水调服三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-9osn38s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-9osn38s","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、泄痢。用白面一斤，炒焦黄，每天空心服一、二匙，温水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-z5xd9nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-z5xd9nb","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、咽喉肿痛，不能吞食。用白面和醋调匀，涂喉外肿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-0p54etd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-0p54etd","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、乳痈不消。用白面半斤，炒黄，加荆煮成糊敷涂，即消。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-d6t4105","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-d6t4105","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、刀伤血出。用生面干敷，五、七日即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-7m69cpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-7m69cpp","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、远行脚上起泡。水调生面涂上，一夜即消。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-9ksy9hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-9ksy9hu","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、火烧成疮。用炒面加栀子仁末，调油涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-obnsl9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-obnsl9u","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、防止受孕。用白面一升、酒一升，煮沸去渣，分三次服下（来月经的头一天晚上，第二天黎明及大明以后各服一次）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-278925d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-278925d","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、一切疔肿。用猪油调面封患处，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-5gsf8re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-5gsf8re","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦粉：痈疽发背，地铭肿毒。用陈年麦粉，久炒成黄黑色，冷定后，研为末，加陈醋调成糊，熬如黑漆，收存瓷罐中。同时摊纸上，剪孔贴患处，疼痛渐消。以后肿毒亦消，此方屡试屡验，药易得而功极显。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-hqh9cu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-hqh9cu2","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面筋：解热和中。糗：消渴止烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-yhiqoru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-yhiqoru","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦苗：消酒毒，解时疾狂热，退胸膈热，利小肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-lejkpr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-lejkpr0","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦取：阳毒、温毒、热极发狂，大渴及温热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130952-ct43t39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130952-ct43t39","updated":"20240614130952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦秆：烧灰加在去疣痣、蚀恶肉的药膏中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130740-3d8odg5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130740-3d8odg5"}},{"ID":"20240614130900-jdicj71","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130900-jdicj71","updated":"20240614130905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130900-r2wzbdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130900-r2wzbdv","updated":"20240614130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】无。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130900-j36ubvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130900-j36ubvd","updated":"20240614130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、微苦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"《素问》：肺色白，宜食苦，麦、羊肉、杏、薤皆苦。小麦是手太阴药。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入足太阴脾、足阳明胃、手太阴肺经。润辛金之枯燥，通壬水之淋涩，能清烦渴，善止悲伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130900-376wshk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130900-376wshk","updated":"20240614130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甘麦大枣汤"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草三两，小麦一升，大枣十枚"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。治妇人脏躁，悲伤欲哭，数欠伸者。以厥阴风木之气，最耗精血，风动而伤肺津，金燥则悲伤欲哭。五脏之志，在肺为悲，在肾为恐。五脏之声，在肺为哭。盖肺津燥降，则化肾水，物情喜升而恶降，升则得意而为喜，降则失意而为恐，悲者，恐之先机也。阳气将降，则生欠伸，欠伸者，阴引而下，阳引而上，未能即降也。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"义详《灵枢·口问》。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘草培土，大枣滋乙木而息风，小麦润辛金而除燥也。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"此与消渴，俱厥阴病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130900-ca5w77r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130900-ca5w77r","updated":"20240614130900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦粥生津止渴，除烦泻热，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白术散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在白术"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。用之治心烦作呕，以清心而除烦也。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枳实芍药散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在枳实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。用之治痈脓，以其泻热而除湿也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130740-ynupgfp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130740-ynupgfp"}},{"ID":"20240614130751-0kzeids","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130751-0kzeids","updated":"20240614130805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130751-5f5pi4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130751-5f5pi4o","updated":"20240614130751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒，无毒。主除热，止燥渴、咽干，利小便，养肝气，止漏血唾血。以作曲，温。消谷，止痢。以作面，温，不能消热，止烦。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-az01qrp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-az01qrp","updated":"20240614130941"}},{"ID":"20240614130941-m0361el","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-m0361el","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小麦《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-49byssn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-49byssn","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为禾本科植物小麦的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-xqrh26y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-xqrh26y","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘，平。入心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-jj1ixtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-jj1ixtw","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】养心安神。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-o427enl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-o427enl","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于神志不宁，失眠等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-ucy5vvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-ucy5vvd","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品善于养心以宁神志，对于神志失常以及夜寐不安等心神不宁之症，常常配合炙甘草、大枣等药同用，有养心安神作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-o6e0cey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-o6e0cey","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】小麦、淮小麦（晒干用）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-zxk27km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-zxk27km","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】五钱至一两，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130941-ugmhl9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130941-ugmhl9t","updated":"20240614130941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】甘麦大枣汤《金匮要略》：甘草、小麦、大枣。治脏躁，常悲伤欲哭，精神恍惚，不能自主，烦躁不安等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130740-kdpb8tk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130740-kdpb8tk"}},{"ID":"20240614130741-hfyfogk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-hfyfogk","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：小麦"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-j7ax8w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-j7ax8w7","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-vhcma5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-vhcma5c","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiǎo Mài"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-nrvrh9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-nrvrh9d","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-dj2wgsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-dj2wgsm","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-fs31bb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-fs31bb4","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-all2uuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-all2uuu","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为禾本科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小麦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子或其面粉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-um3wn1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-um3wn1e","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-rl1rlqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-rl1rlqd","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-yr6zgir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-yr6zgir","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-bswmg49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-bswmg49","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一年生或二年生草本，高60～100厘米。秆直立，通常具6～9节。叶鞘光滑，常较节间为短；叶舌膜质，短小；叶片扁平，长披针形，长15～40厘米，宽8～14毫米，先端渐尖，基部方圆形。穗状花序直立，长3～10厘米；小穗两侧扁平，长约12毫米，在穗轴上平行排列或近于平行，每小穗具3～9花，仅下部的花结实。小穗节间约1毫米；颖短，革质，第1颖较第2颖为宽，两者背面均具有锐利的脊，有时延伸成芒，具6～9纵脉，外稃膜质，微裂成3齿状，中央的齿常延伸成芒，背面5～9脉，内稃与外稃等长或略短，脊上具鳞毛状的窄翼，翼缘被细毛；雄蕊3枚，花药长1.5～2毫米，丁字着生，花丝细长，子房卵形。颖果矩圆形或近卵形，长约6毫米，浅褐色。花期4～5月。果期5～6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-z1sb3wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-z1sb3wd","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的茎叶（小麦苗）、干瘪轻浮的种子（浮小麦）、种皮（小麦麸）亦供药用。各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-nue1297","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-nue1297","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-0nbrttf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-0nbrttf","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、脾、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-k7haxwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-k7haxwg","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入手少阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-1xc7yh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-1xc7yh6","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经解》：\"入足少阴肾经，足太阴脾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-bd8w81k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-bd8w81k","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-4xem37v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-4xem37v","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-9qh27rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-9qh27rt","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"甘，微寒，无毒。面温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-q3qjz49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-q3qjz49","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②孟诜：\"平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ekf5zrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ekf5zrv","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草拾遗》：\"皮寒，肉热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-56x6p0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-56x6p0a","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"新麦性热，陈麦平和，小麦面甘，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-73ognft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-73ognft","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-vz3z3yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-vz3z3yj","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目》：\"小麦面畏汉椒、萝菔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-8c4ctvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-8c4ctvc","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ddxjyyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ddxjyyg","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养心，益肾，除热，止渴。治脏躁，烦热，消揭，泄利，痈肿，外伤出血，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-9ew63gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-9ew63gg","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"除热，止燥渴，利小便，养肝气，止漏血，唾血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-8mgt06j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-8mgt06j","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草拾遗》：\"小麦面，补虚，实人肤体，厚肠胃，强气力。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-obvub91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-obvub91","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》：\"陈者煎汤饮，止虚汗；烧存性，油调涂诸疮，汤火灼伤。\"\"小麦面敷痈肿损伤，散血止痛。生食利大肠，水调服止鼻衄、吐血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-c3yzthm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-c3yzthm","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医林纂要》：\"除烦，止血，利小便，润肺燥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-br5vx1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-br5vx1u","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"养心，益肾，和血，健脾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-yoqvea1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-yoqvea1","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-6oss8c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-6oss8c9","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：小麦煎汤，1～2两；或煮粥。小麦面冷水调服或炒黄温水调服。外用：小麦炒黑研末调敷。小麦面干撒或炒黄调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-2ln3r0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-2ln3r0n","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ksox3cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ksox3cc","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人脏躁，喜悲伤欲哭，数欠伸：甘草三两，小麦一升，大枣十枚。上三味，以水六升，煮取三升，温分三服。亦补脾气。（《金匮要略》甘麦大枣汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-12ky2un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-12ky2un","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治消渴口干：小麦用炊作饭及煮粥食之。（《食医心镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-r50js1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-r50js1n","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治滑痢肠胃不固：白面一斤，炒令焦黄，每日空心温水调（服）一匙头。（《饮膳正要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-rtaiou8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-rtaiou8","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治内损吐血：飞罗面不计多少，微炒过，浓磨细墨一茶脚，调下二钱。（《产乳备要》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-691q795","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-691q795","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治老人五淋，身热腹满：小麦一升，通草二两。水三升，煮取一升饮之。（《养老奉亲书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-7n3oge8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-7n3oge8","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治妇人乳痈不消：白面半斤，炒令黄色，醋煮为糊，涂于乳上。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-kog9wor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-kog9wor","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治金疮血出不止：生面干敷。（《葡氏经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-l7zivli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-l7zivli","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治火燎成疮：炒面，入栀子仁末，和油调（涂）之.（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-wz1gely","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-wz1gely","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治汤火伤未成疮者：小麦炒黑为度，研为末，腻粉减半，油调涂之。（《经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-7htlkmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-7htlkmk","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-cyd3n46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-cyd3n46","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治疗外科感染：取陈小麦2斤，加水3斤，浸泡3天后捣烂、过滤、去渣，滤液沉淀后取沉淀物晒干，小火炒至焦黄研细。临用时将药粉加醋适量调成糊状，外敷疮疖、丹毒等患处，日2次，已溃者敷疮口四周。据数千例观察，有效率在90％以上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-4pj33me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-4pj33me","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-war6npq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-war6npq","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-cxio9yg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-cxio9yg","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：小麦"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-vd75z1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-vd75z1x","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-5ibx0pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-5ibx0pg","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiǎo Mài"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ux0ofqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ux0ofqt","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-pv3ocxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-pv3ocxu","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 来、麳"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-pnkrcg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-pnkrcg8","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-5n431ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-5n431ui","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" wheat seed"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-rngnre8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-rngnre8","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ua85m4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ua85m4r","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草经集注》1.陶弘景：小麦合汤，皆完用之，热家疗也，作用则温，明穬麦亦当如此。2.《唐本草》：小麦汤用，不许皮坼，云坼则温，明面不能消热止烦也。3.《本草图经》：小麦性寒，作面则温而有毒，作曲则平胃止利。其皮为麸，性复寒，调中去热，亦犹大豆作酱豉，性便不同也。4.《纲目》：小麦面，医方中往往用飞罗面，取其无石味而性平易尔。陈麦面煮水食之无毒。以糟发胀者，能发病发疮，惟作蒸饼和药，取其易消也"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-yt7ypy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-yt7ypy5","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-35jvnjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-35jvnjs","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为禾本科植物小麦的种子或其面粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-feovq2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-feovq2m","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Triticum aestivum L."}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-esrffz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-esrffz9","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：成熟时采收，脱粒晒干，或机成面粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-cpdc7xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-cpdc7xn","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-4gr3u2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-4gr3u2j","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国各地均有栽培，为我国主要食粮之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-kbtdcux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-kbtdcux","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-qkf7agt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-qkf7agt","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 小麦，一年生或越年生草本，高60-100cm。秆直立，通常6-9节。叶鞘光滑，常较节间为短；叶舌膜质，短小；叶片扁平，长披针形，长15-40cm，宽8-14mm，先端渐尖，基部方圆形。穗状花序直立，长3-10cm；小穗两侧扁平，长约12mm，在穗轴上平行排列或近于科行，每小穗具3-9花，仅下部的花结实；颖短，第1颖较第2颖为宽，两者背面均具有锐利的脊，有时延伸成芒；外稃膜质，微裂成3齿状，中央的齿常延伸成芒，内稃与外稃等长或略短，脊上具鳞毛状的窄翼；雄蕊3；子房卵形。颖果长圆形或近卵形，长约6mm，浅褐色。花期4-5月，果期5-6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ghcc2z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ghcc2z3","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-aixui7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-aixui7s","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 种子含淀粉53%-70%，蛋白质约11%，糖类2%-7%，糊精2%-10%，脂肪约1.6%，粗纤维约2%。脂肪主要为油酸(oleic acid)、亚油酸(linoleic acid)、棕榈酸(sitosterol)、硬脂酸(stearic acid)的甘油酯。尚含少量谷甾醇(sitosterol)、卵磷脂(lecithin)、尿囊素(allantoin)、精氨酸(arginine)、淀粉酶(amylase)、麦芽糖酶(maltase)、蛋自酶(protease)及微量维生素(vitamin)B等。麦胚含植物凝集素。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-ox0z78a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-ox0z78a","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-3fkxr9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-3fkxr9u","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 镇痛及抗病毒作用，从小麦中提取的脂多糖（LPSw）静脉注射或灌胃，均可抑制醋酸引起的小鼠扭体反应，有显着的镇痛作用，LPSw可激活巨噬细胞而发挥抗病毒作用，临床上对各种疱疹患者有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-xhflgk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-xhflgk1","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-cfxvg85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-cfxvg85","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；脾；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-73osb5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-73osb5d","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-lz239hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-lz239hq","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-usifp1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-usifp1t","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-rbsf80r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-rbsf80r","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 小麦面畏汉椒、萝菔。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-nwluhjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-nwluhjh","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-yjj0bh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-yjj0bh2","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 养心；益肾；除热；止渴。主脏躁；烦热；消渴；泄利；痈肿；外伤出血；烫伤"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-vh7gyzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-vh7gyzl","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-rloc8u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-rloc8u6","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：小麦煎汤，50-100g；或煮粥。小麦面炒黄温水调服。外用：适量，小麦炒黑研末调敷。小麦面干撒或炒黄调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-jzzdhkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-jzzdhkc","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-nzbjuql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-nzbjuql","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《别录》除热，止燥渴，利小便，养肝气，止漏血，唾血。2.《本草拾遗》：小麦面，补虚，实人肤体，厚肠胃，强气力。3.《纲目》：陈者煎汤饮，止虚汗；烧存性，油调涂诸疮，汤火灼伤。小麦面敷痈肿损伤，散血止痛。生食利大肠，水调服止鼻衄、吐血。4、《医林纂要》：除烦，止血，利小便，润肺燥。5、《本草再新》：养心，益肾，和血，健脾。"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-hjhfd1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-hjhfd1v","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614130741-x890r39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130741-x890r39","updated":"20240614130741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614130742-cq7mp3q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614130742-cq7mp3q"}},{"ID":"20240614130743-pjqox70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614130743-pjqox70"}}]}